  },
  {
    "id": "230",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 4584,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "避免长期囤积"
  },
  {
    "id": "231",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 4584,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "重置"
  },
  {
    "id": "81",
    "type": "heading2",
    "y": 4690,
    "cls": "block docx-heading2-block",
    "text": "5.1 洞察分怎么讲给用户"
  },
  {
    "id": "82",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 4728,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "第一版不用在界面上展示复杂公式。告诉用户：猜对方向会加分；概率给得越准，分数越高；明明只有五五开却写 95%，猜错会掉更多分。"
  },
  {
    "id": "83",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 4788,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "一场比赛显示 0 到 100 分。用户完成多场比赛后，再展示长期校准能力和准确率。看台豆的输赢和洞察分分开记录，避免把运气当成判断力。"
  },
  {
    "id": "84",
    "type": "heading2",
    "y": 4862,
    "cls": "block docx-heading2-block",
    "text": "5.2 排行榜"
  },
  {
    "id": "85",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 4901,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n洞察榜：看谁长期预测得准。"
  },
  {
    "id": "86",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 4935,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n看台榜：看谁在用豆挑战中表现好。"
  },
  {
    "id": "87",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 4969,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n好友联赛优先展示熟人排名，提高参与和讨论意愿。"
  },
  {
    "id": "88",
    "type": "heading2",
    "y": 5017,
    "cls": "block docx-heading2-block",
    "text": "5.3洞察分和看台豆的计算"
  },
  {
    "id": "89",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 5056,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "概率判断计算洞察分，洞察分决定挑战成功时的看台豆收益；方向没猜中则固定亏损挑战豆。"
  },
  {
    "id": "90",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5056,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "概率判断计算洞察分，洞察分决定挑战成功时的看台豆收益；方向没猜中则固定亏损挑战豆。"
  },
  {
    "id": "91",
    "type": "heading3",
    "y": 5102,
    "cls": "block docx-heading3-block",
    "text": "一、先计算洞察分"
  },
  {
    "id": "92",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5138,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "用户给三个结果分配概率："
  },
  {
    "id": "93",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 5172,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n巴萨胜 p₁"
  },
  {
    "id": "94",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 5207,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n平局 p₂"
  },
  {
    "id": "95",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 5242,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n曼城胜 p₃"
  },
  {
    "id": "96",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5277,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "比赛结束后，实际结果记为："
  },
  {
    "id": "97",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 5311,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n巴萨胜：`y = 1, 0, 0`"
  },
  {
    "id": "98",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 5345,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n平局：`y = 0, 1, 0`"
  },
  {
    "id": "99",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 5379,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n曼城胜：`y = 0, 0, 1`"
  },
  {
    "id": "100",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5413,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "先计算 Brier Score："
  },
  {
    "id": "101",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 5455,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\nB = (p₁ - y₁)² + (p₂ - y₂)² + (p₃ - y₃)²"
  },
  {
    "id": "102",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5568,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "B 越低，说明越准。"
  },
  {
    "id": "103",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5602,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "再换算成 0 到 100 的洞察分："
  },
  {
    "id": "104",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 5644,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n洞察分 S = round(100 × (1 - B / 2))"
  },
  {
    "id": "105",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5757,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "round 表示四舍五入。页面显示整数分，后台结算也用这个整数，避免用户看到的分数和实际奖励不一致。"
  },
  {
    "id": "106",
    "type": "heading3",
    "y": 5804,
    "cls": "block docx-heading3-block",
    "text": "二、举个例子"
  },
  {
    "id": "107",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 5840,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "用户判断："
  },
  {
    "id": "109",
    "type": "heading4",
    "y": 6031,
    "cls": "block docx-heading4-block",
    "text": "巴萨真的获胜"
  },
  {
    "id": "110",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 6072,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\nB = (0.64 - 1)² + (0.22 - 0)² + (0.14 - 0)²\nB = 0.1976\n\nS = 100 × (1 - 0.1976 / 2)\nS = 90.12"
  },
  {
    "id": "111",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6266,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "页面显示："
  },
  {
    "id": "112",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 6300,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "本场洞察分 90"
  },
  {
    "id": "238",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6300,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "本场洞察分 90"
  },
  {
    "id": "113",
    "type": "heading4",
    "y": 6344,
    "cls": "block docx-heading4-block",
    "text": "实际是曼城获胜"
  },
  {
    "id": "114",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 6385,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\nB = (0.64 - 0)² + (0.22 - 0)² + (0.14 - 1)²\nB = 1.1976\n\nS = 100 × (1 - 1.1976 / 2)\nS = 40.12"
  },
  {
    "id": "115",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6579,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "页面显示："
  },
  {
    "id": "116",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 6613,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "本场洞察分 40"
  },
  {
    "id": "239",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6613,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "本场洞察分 40"
  },
  {
    "id": "117",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6647,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "洞察分奖励的不是“敢喊”，而是“概率给得准”。高概率押错会掉分，合理分配概率则更容易拿到高分。"
  },
  {
    "id": "119",
    "type": "heading3",
    "y": 6727,
    "cls": "block docx-heading3-block",
    "text": "三、看台豆怎么结算"
  },
  {
    "id": "120",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6763,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "挑战时，用户先从 10 / 30 / 50 中选一个挑战豆数量 C。"
  },
  {
    "id": "121",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6798,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "挑战结果分三种："
  },
  {
    "id": "122",
    "type": "heading4",
    "y": 6842,
    "cls": "block docx-heading4-block",
    "text": "1.\n方向命中"
  },
  {
    "id": "123",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6876,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "方向命中是指："
  },
  {
    "id": "124",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 6910,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "用户概率最高的结果 = 实际结果"
  },
  {
    "id": "240",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6910,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "用户概率最高的结果 = 实际结果"
  },
  {
    "id": "125",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 6944,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "命中时："
  },
  {
    "id": "126",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 6986,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n基础收益系数 R = min(0.8, max(0, (S - 60) / 50))"
  },
  {
    "id": "127",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 7099,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "意思是："
  },
  {
    "id": "128",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 7133,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n洞察分 60，奖励率为 0%；"
  },
  {
    "id": "129",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 7167,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n洞察分 80，奖励率为 40%；"
  },
  {
    "id": "130",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 7201,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n洞察分 90，奖励率为 60%；"
  },
  {
    "id": "131",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 7235,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n洞察分 100，奖励率为最高 80%。"
  },
  {
    "id": "132",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 7269,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "奖励豆："
  },
  {
    "id": "133",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 7311,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n奖励豆 = 挑战豆 C × 收益系数 R"
  },
  {
    "id": "134",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 7424,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "用户最终拿回："
  },
  {
    "id": "135",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 7466,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n返还本金 C + 奖励豆"
  },
  {
    "id": "136",
    "type": "heading4",
    "y": 7581,
    "cls": "block docx-heading4-block",
    "text": "2.\n方向未命中"
  },
  {
    "id": "137",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 7614,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "不管洞察分多少："
  },
  {
    "id": "138",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 7656,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n亏损 = 挑战豆 C"
  },
  {
    "id": "139",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 7769,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "扣除挑战豆，不返本金。"
  },
  {
    "id": "140",
    "type": "heading3",
    "y": 7815,
    "cls": "block docx-heading3-block",
    "text": "1.\n比赛取消或无法结算"
  },
  {
    "id": "141",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 7859,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n亏损 = 0"
  },
  {
    "id": "142",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 7972,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "原数返还挑战豆。"
  },
  {
    "id": "144",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 8040,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "假设用户选择挑战 50 豆："
  },
  {
    "id": "146",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 8337,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "如果用户赛前余额是 1000："
  },
  {
    "id": "147",
    "type": "heading4",
    "y": 8381,
    "cls": "block docx-heading4-block",
    "text": "方向命中、洞察分 90"
  },
  {
    "id": "148",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 8422,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n提交挑战：1000 - 50 = 950\n完成结算：950 + 50 + 30 = 1030"
  },
  {
    "id": "149",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 8550,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "最终："
  },
  {
    "id": "150",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 8584,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "看台豆 1030\n本场净收益 +30"
  },
  {
    "id": "241",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 8584,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "看台豆 1030\n本场净收益 +30"
  },
  {
    "id": "151",
    "type": "heading4",
    "y": 8654,
    "cls": "block docx-heading4-block",
    "text": "方向未命中"
  },
  {
    "id": "152",
    "type": "code",
    "y": 8695,
    "cls": "block docx-code-block",
    "text": "代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\n提交挑战：1000 - 50 = 950\n完成结算：不返还"
  },
  {
    "id": "153",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 8823,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "最终："
  },
  {
    "id": "154",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 8857,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "看台豆 950\n本场净亏损 -50"
  },
  {
    "id": "242",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 8857,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "看台豆 950\n本场净亏损 -50"
  },
  {
    "id": "157",
    "type": "heading1",
    "y": 9003,
    "cls": "block docx-heading1-block",
    "text": "06 边界和待定项"
