    "type": "text",
    "y": 9380,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "站外博彩、跟单和私域返利入口"
  },
  {
    "id": "270",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 9380,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "与资讯产品的边界冲突"
  },
  {
    "id": "165",
    "type": "heading2",
    "y": 9622,
    "cls": "block docx-heading2-block",
    "text": "规则玩法"
  },
  {
    "id": "166",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 9661,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "假设一场比赛是："
  },
  {
    "id": "167",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 9695,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "主队胜、平局、客队胜"
  },
  {
    "id": "168",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 9729,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "系统显示当前球迷共识："
  },
  {
    "id": "170",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 9918,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "这不是赔率，也不是平台承诺的概率，而是所有用户的预测经过汇总后形成的“球迷意见”。"
  },
  {
    "id": "171",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 9952,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "用户小明看完阵容后，可以提交自己的判断："
  },
  {
    "id": "173",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10141,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "三项加起来是 100%。"
  },
  {
    "id": "174",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10175,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "小明不需要充值，不扣金币，也不能把这份判断卖给别人。他只是在回答："
  },
  {
    "id": "175",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 10209,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "“我认为主队有 64% 的概率赢。”"
  },
  {
    "id": "271",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10209,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "“我认为主队有 64% 的概率赢。”"
  },
  {
    "id": "176",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10243,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "比赛开始前最多修改 3 次，开赛后判断锁定。"
  },
  {
    "id": "177",
    "type": "heading2",
    "y": 10291,
    "cls": "block docx-heading2-block",
    "text": "球迷共识怎么变化"
  },
  {
    "id": "178",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10330,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "系统把所有用户的概率汇总起来，动态显示："
  },
  {
    "id": "179",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 10364,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "主胜概率从 52% 降到 46%。"
  },
  {
    "id": "272",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10364,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "主胜概率从 52% 降到 46%。"
  },
  {
    "id": "180",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10398,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "可能原因是："
  },
  {
    "id": "181",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 10432,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n主队首发阵容轮换；"
  },
  {
    "id": "182",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 10466,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n核心后卫受伤；"
  },
  {
    "id": "183",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 10500,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n客队近期状态提升；"
  },
  {
    "id": "184",
    "type": "bullet",
    "y": 10534,
    "cls": "block docx-bullet-block",
    "text": "•\n大量球迷改变了判断。"
  },
  {
    "id": "185",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10568,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "这里借用了 Polymarket 的“概率会随新信息变化”的体验，但没有资金仓位，也没有买卖获利。"
  },
  {
    "id": "186",
    "type": "heading2",
    "y": 10616,
    "cls": "block docx-heading2-block",
    "text": "赛后怎么算胜负"
  },
  {
    "id": "187",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10654,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "假设小明给出了 64 / 22 / 14 的判断。"
  },
  {
    "id": "188",
    "type": "heading3",
    "y": 10700,
    "cls": "block docx-heading3-block",
    "text": "主队获胜"
  },
  {
    "id": "189",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10736,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "小明最高概率的方向猜中了，同时概率分配也比较合理："
  },
  {
    "id": "190",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 10770,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "方向命中\n洞察分：90"
  },
  {
    "id": "273",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10770,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "方向命中\n洞察分：90"
  },
  {
    "id": "191",
    "type": "heading3",
    "y": 10842,
    "cls": "block docx-heading3-block",
    "text": "客队获胜"
  },
  {
    "id": "192",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10878,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "小明虽然更看好主队，但实际结果完全相反："
  },
  {
    "id": "193",
    "type": "quote_container",
    "y": 10912,
    "cls": "block docx-quote_container-block",
    "text": "方向未命中\n洞察分：40"
  },
  {
    "id": "274",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10912,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block quote-container-render-unit",
    "text": "方向未命中\n洞察分：40"
  },
  {
    "id": "194",
    "type": "text",
    "y": 10972,
    "cls": "block docx-text-block",
    "text": "评分不只奖励“猜对方向”，还会检查用户是否过度自信。一个总说“90% 必赢”却经常猜错的人，长期分数会下降；一个给出合理概率、长期判断稳定的人，会获得较高排名。"
  }
]